I'll probably get this wrong, but I'll try anyway.

The question is what is the minimum number of wishes to get from a
wand of wishing (WOW).

The answers so far are:

1
2
3
4
5
6
7
42	<-- (my favorite so far)

I think that you can end up with no wishes.  Your game could be cursed
or you could be plain unlucky.  This can even happen with the WOW from
the castle.

Spoilers follow:

If your luck is negative, a WOW may not give you a wish.  In fact if
your luck is -5 or less you will not get a wish.

If your wand of wishing is cursed, then you have a 1/100 chance of the
wand exploding.  With the liches on the castle level you may have to
watch out for this.

If you have good luck and know that the wand is not cursed, then you
can get one wish from the wand even if it is found on a bones level.
(Well this is not exactly true.  If the wand on a bones level was
wished for then this wand will never give you a wish.)

If the wand was not on a bones level, then it will have a charge of at
least one, and will not have been previously charged.  You can then
get 5 wishes out of this wand.

1 wish from the original charge.
3 wishes after you have recharged the wand with a blessed scroll of charging.
1 more wish can then be wrest from the worn out wand.

Now that I have said this I am almost certain that I have made an
mistake somewhere.

